# The all-in-one deployment builds from the repository root, so its own state
# has to be excluded here too — the patterns above only match the top level.
# Without the first line the WAHA Chromium profile ships to the daemon on every
# build; without the second, a filled-in .env lands in the builder layer.
deployment/*/data
deployment/*/.env
